# SupportDesk AI — example requests (VS Code REST Client, Visual Studio or JetBrains HTTP client).
# Start the API first:  dotnet run --project src/SupportDesk.Api --launch-profile http
# Use demo data only. Replace the ids below with ids that exist in your database.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5189
@ticketId = 1

### Create a ticket -> 201 Created with a Location header
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unable to access my account",
  "description": "I reset my password but still cannot sign in."
}

### Create with invalid input -> 400 ProblemDetails naming the field
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "  ",
  "description": "short"
}

### List all tickets (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

### List with filters (combined with AND, case-insensitive enum names)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=Open&priority=High

### Invalid filter -> 400 listing the allowed values
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=Pending

### Get one ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}

### Unknown id -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/999999

### Non-numeric id -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/abc

### Update title, description and priority (status cannot be changed here)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cannot sign in after password reset",
  "description": "I reset my password twice and still cannot sign in to my account.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Change status (Open, InProgress, Resolved, Closed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### Invalid status -> 400 listing the allowed values
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Done"
}

### AI analysis (needs a Groq key; 503 without one). Saves the validated result and overwrites priority.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/analyze

### AI draft reply (needs a Groq key). Stored for human review; never sent.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/draft-reply

### Dashboard counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
